      "statement": "Every stated percentage is w/w; all listed stocks are ready as described. Neroli is owned neat. Red Saffron Infusion is the maximum-concentration as-supplied DPG product and is execution-ready at product-stock fraction 1.0, while its proprietary saffron-active fraction remains undisclosed. Geranyl Acetate is owned neat. Ambrofix remains heterogeneous and verify-first because crystals are visible.",
